1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:10,680
With their valuable skills and experience, elderly people can continue to make significant contributions to society.
老年人凭借自己宝贵的技能和经验，可以继续为社会做出重要贡献。

2
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:20,370
Retirement does not have to mean the end of a useful life; instead, it can open a new chapter in which older people share what they have learned over decades.
退休不一定意味着有用人生的终结；相反，它可以开启一个新的篇章，让老年人分享自己几十年来学到的东西。

3
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:24,660
Many of them are still energetic and eager to stay involved.
他们中的许多人依然精力充沛，渴望继续参与社会生活。

4
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:28,830
In my own neighborhood, I have seen this again and again.
在我自己住的社区，我就一次又一次地看到这种情况。

5
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:39,430
A retired engineer repairs household appliances for free every weekend, and a former teacher runs an after-school reading club for children whose parents work late.
一位退休工程师每个周末都免费为大家修理家用电器，一位退休教师为父母下班晚的孩子开办了课后阅读俱乐部。

6
00:00:40,230 --> 00:00:45,060
My grandfather, a retired doctor, is a particularly good example.
我的祖父是一位退休医生，他就是一个特别好的例子。

7
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:54,400
Once a month he gives free health talks at our community center, and thanks to his advice, many neighbors now check their blood pressure regularly.
他每月在我们的社区中心举办一次免费健康讲座，多亏了他的建议，如今许多邻居都定期测量血压。

8
00:00:55,200 --> 00:01:00,890
These contributions may seem small, but they make the neighborhood a warmer, friendlier place.
这些贡献也许看起来微不足道，却让社区变成一个更温暖、更友好的地方。

9
00:01:01,690 --> 00:01:07,870
Moreover, by staying active, these elderly people keep themselves healthy and find their lives meaningful.
此外，这些老年人通过保持活跃，让自己身体健康，也感到生活有意义。

10
00:01:08,670 --> 00:01:18,540
Society should therefore create more opportunities for older people to contribute, such as flexible part-time jobs and volunteer programs suited to their abilities.
因此，社会应当为老年人创造更多发挥作用的机会，比如灵活的兼职工作和适合他们能力的志愿者项目。

11
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:26,160
Young people, for their part, should respect the elderly, listen to their stories and learn from their experience.
年轻人则应当尊重老人，倾听他们的故事，向他们的经验学习。

12
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:30,390
When the wisdom of age is valued, everyone benefits.
当年长者的智慧受到重视时，每个人都会受益。
